WEBVTT

00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:10.500
I finally found...

00:00:11.620 --> 00:00:14.200
the peace I lost so long ago.

00:00:19.230 --> 00:00:20.880
I finally found...

00:00:22.030 --> 00:00:23.920
the peace that was so long denied to me.

00:00:36.020 --> 00:00:38.050
And then, he came and shattered it...

00:01:22.490 --> 00:01:25.060
Kagura!

00:01:28.950 --> 00:01:30.380
You...

00:01:30.980 --> 00:01:33.030
You'll pay for this!

00:03:11.520 --> 00:03:13.920
Damn it, Izumo...

00:03:15.280 --> 00:03:16.150
Silvie?

00:03:19.550 --> 00:03:23.250
Silvie, my terrible smelly wench.

00:03:23.960 --> 00:03:26.310
I'm never going to let you go.

00:03:27.260 --> 00:03:29.560
The world can burn first!

00:03:39.570 --> 00:03:40.320
What?

00:03:41.750 --> 00:03:42.860
Has the reaper come for me?

00:03:43.700 --> 00:03:47.870
You think I'm the Grim Reaper?

00:03:47.870 --> 00:03:50.820
Sorry, the only reaper here...

00:03:50.820 --> 00:03:52.750
is you!

00:04:05.310 --> 00:04:07.350
It's part of their Machine Angel!

00:04:07.860 --> 00:04:10.380
Why do I hear the pilot's voice?

00:04:10.380 --> 00:04:11.630
Why do you think?

00:04:12.230 --> 00:04:17.290
Because I'm you, and you're me!

00:04:17.290 --> 00:04:21.240
And that's exactly why I'm going to make you pay for what you did!

00:04:21.240 --> 00:04:22.240
What?

00:04:22.680 --> 00:04:25.240
You killed our father!

00:04:25.240 --> 00:04:27.490
Our father? Who?

00:04:27.490 --> 00:04:30.750
Izumo, the commander of Altair!

00:04:34.870 --> 00:04:36.630
It's your fault!

00:04:38.460 --> 00:04:40.960
You took everything from me!

00:04:50.090 --> 00:04:52.810
Shut up, Amata, you worthless wimp.

00:04:54.630 --> 00:04:56.310
You think you're so cool because you can Union by yourself?

00:04:57.580 --> 00:05:02.570
Well, I can do anything you can do!

00:05:09.200 --> 00:05:12.250
You can't escape from me!

00:05:19.670 --> 00:05:20.420
What?

00:05:26.180 --> 00:05:28.640
Now we're even.

00:05:47.930 --> 00:05:51.330
Two pieces of a divided soul.

00:05:52.760 --> 00:05:56.360
Two pieces of the Machine Angel coming together.

00:05:57.210 --> 00:06:03.960
The red dream will soon meet the blue of reality.

00:06:45.330 --> 00:06:47.380
Chairman Crea, what is happening?

00:06:48.200 --> 00:06:49.540
A red planet!

00:06:50.010 --> 00:06:52.530
Is that...?

00:06:52.530 --> 00:06:53.760
Altair.

00:06:54.770 --> 00:06:56.530
We're detecting Gepard!

00:06:56.530 --> 00:06:58.770
It's engaged with an Abductor!

00:06:58.770 --> 00:06:59.770
What?

00:07:04.990 --> 00:07:06.690
Mix!

00:07:12.070 --> 00:07:14.030
Let me in, Mix!

00:07:15.530 --> 00:07:17.540
Spatial Augmentation!

00:07:19.040 --> 00:07:21.690
You won't get through to him, Andy!

00:07:21.690 --> 00:07:24.330
And if you keep using up your power at this rate, you'll be a goner!

00:07:24.330 --> 00:07:27.300
I can't give up and leave Mix!

00:07:28.300 --> 00:07:30.550
I'm staying right here, Mix!

00:07:31.300 --> 00:07:34.180
Until I have you in my arms!

00:07:37.510 --> 00:07:46.940
Mix!

00:07:47.360 --> 00:07:50.440
Why can't you leave me alone?

00:07:51.220 --> 00:07:53.230
<i>Let me fill your hole.</i>

00:07:56.720 --> 00:07:59.200
I hate holes!

00:07:59.200 --> 00:08:01.710
And I absolutely hate you!

00:08:01.710 --> 00:08:03.030
Mix!

00:08:04.460 --> 00:08:05.460
Andy!

00:08:09.960 --> 00:08:11.770
Get back, Andy!

00:08:11.770 --> 00:08:14.180
You want to die here?

00:08:14.970 --> 00:08:17.970
I'm not leaving her now!

00:08:17.970 --> 00:08:26.060
Mix! I'm going to fill that gaping hole in your heart!

00:08:27.030 --> 00:08:29.070
The hole... in my heart?

00:08:35.490 --> 00:08:38.760
Mix!

00:09:00.530 --> 00:09:04.410
You're finally in my arms.

00:09:05.560 --> 00:09:08.860
My Mix.

00:09:12.570 --> 00:09:15.610
The holes in my memories are filling up!

00:09:18.410 --> 00:09:23.000
The memories of when I was a girl...

00:09:24.850 --> 00:09:28.740
And he's in all them...

00:09:36.410 --> 00:09:37.540
Andy!

00:09:49.030 --> 00:09:50.060
Andy!

00:09:50.060 --> 00:09:52.860
Your memories are back?

00:09:53.500 --> 00:09:56.660
Andy.. Andy...

00:09:56.660 --> 00:09:58.950
Mix! Thank-

00:09:58.950 --> 00:10:00.300
No!

00:10:02.290 --> 00:10:03.870
Don't look at me!

00:10:04.740 --> 00:10:08.450
I can't face you looking like this!

00:10:09.030 --> 00:10:10.000
Mix...

00:10:10.310 --> 00:10:13.760
I'm not a girl anymore!

00:10:18.580 --> 00:10:20.480
Doesn't bother me.

00:10:21.680 --> 00:10:25.160
I don't care if you're a boy or a girl.

00:10:25.160 --> 00:10:28.690
The one I love is Mix.

00:10:30.310 --> 00:10:31.340
Andy!

00:10:33.880 --> 00:10:37.010
Can we Union?

00:10:38.330 --> 00:10:39.140
Yeah.

00:10:40.360 --> 00:10:42.180
Are you sure?

00:10:42.830 --> 00:10:43.770
I am.

00:10:43.770 --> 00:10:45.680
You guys are gonna Union right here?

00:10:45.680 --> 00:10:47.500
Did you forget what we're here for?

00:10:49.320 --> 00:10:52.640
I've been saving my purity all this time!

00:10:52.640 --> 00:10:57.010
But now it's time to let that chastity burst open!

00:10:57.600 --> 00:10:59.310
Long-Awaited Union!

00:10:59.310 --> 00:11:00.350
Go!

00:11:00.350 --> 00:11:02.850
Aquarion!

00:11:03.510 --> 00:11:04.260
Um...

00:11:04.850 --> 00:11:07.270
I'm sorry to butt in.

00:11:13.770 --> 00:11:16.600
Welcome home, Andy.

00:11:16.600 --> 00:11:18.280
You too, Mix.

00:11:20.400 --> 00:11:27.960
Kagura! You had Mom and Dad with you this whole time, right here on Altair!

00:11:28.540 --> 00:11:32.800
Everything I didn't have, you had within your reach!

00:11:32.800 --> 00:11:34.210
And what did you do?

00:11:38.600 --> 00:11:42.430
I was never raised by a father or a mother!

00:11:42.430 --> 00:11:43.430
What?

00:11:43.430 --> 00:11:48.180
I was raised by that evil bastard Mikage.

00:11:49.400 --> 00:11:52.000
Living with him was horrible.

00:11:57.020 --> 00:12:03.560
Being with Mikage was more painful than being alone.

00:12:08.050 --> 00:12:10.010
I couldn't trust anyone.

00:12:10.560 --> 00:12:16.180
But the instant I smelled Silvie, my smelly wench, I knew.

00:12:16.790 --> 00:12:21.240
That in all the world, only she would accept me.

00:12:21.240 --> 00:12:22.850
That we were destined for each other!

00:12:23.680 --> 00:12:25.840
I'm going to kill Silvie.

00:12:25.840 --> 00:12:28.440
We're going to kill each other in love.

00:12:28.440 --> 00:12:32.430
I'll give up my worthless parents for that!

00:12:32.430 --> 00:12:33.940
Kagura!

00:12:34.400 --> 00:12:37.020
You're the weak part of me.

00:12:43.610 --> 00:12:47.120
You're weak. Even your love is weak.

00:12:47.800 --> 00:12:53.750
You're the reason why we were separated from Silvie 12,000 years ago!

00:12:53.750 --> 00:12:55.330
No!

00:12:55.330 --> 00:13:00.370
And even in this life, you let our mother slip away, too!

00:13:00.370 --> 00:13:01.760
No, no!

00:13:01.760 --> 00:13:03.880
And now, you're going to lose Silvie!

00:13:03.880 --> 00:13:06.640
No! No!

00:13:08.390 --> 00:13:11.210
You're wrong!

00:13:19.650 --> 00:13:23.360
Altair is still approaching! It's actually accelerating!

00:13:24.090 --> 00:13:28.630
They're going to collide. It's like the worlds are following Amata's fight.

00:13:29.180 --> 00:13:30.230
Chairman?

00:13:34.270 --> 00:13:39.560
This is the next page being written in the Book of Twin Stars.

00:13:40.290 --> 00:13:43.860
As two fragments of one soul call to one another,

00:13:43.860 --> 00:13:48.520
the two worlds are drawn together until they collide.

00:13:50.710 --> 00:13:55.580
The old will die, and a new world will be born in their place.

00:13:56.310 --> 00:13:59.590
A world where Mikage will be a god.

00:13:59.590 --> 00:14:02.650
Is that the ending you wanted?

00:14:04.470 --> 00:14:07.710
You've been watching this world silently,

00:14:07.710 --> 00:14:11.340
and I've been watching you the same way.

00:14:12.290 --> 00:14:16.540
You've been Immovable through the worst of times.

00:14:17.360 --> 00:14:19.960
But what about this?

00:14:20.480 --> 00:14:25.460
All living things will be sacrificed to the new world.

00:14:25.460 --> 00:14:28.560
Even the students of our school.

00:14:29.590 --> 00:14:33.100
All because it was foretold in the Book of Twin Stars.

00:14:33.510 --> 00:14:38.700
Are you going to silently allow all those deaths?

00:14:40.100 --> 00:14:42.860
Is this truly what you want?

00:14:43.480 --> 00:14:45.110
Fudo Zen!

00:14:54.890 --> 00:14:55.980
Fudo!

00:15:03.780 --> 00:15:08.260
When I met Mikono, I felt it was destiny, too!

00:15:08.260 --> 00:15:12.140
Someone who shared my pain, who understood me!

00:15:12.140 --> 00:15:13.890
But that's not all about her!

00:15:14.640 --> 00:15:19.640
She's shy, she has a short temper,
and she gets jealous for no reason!

00:15:19.640 --> 00:15:22.560
Don't you praise her like that!

00:15:25.320 --> 00:15:31.200
But always she does her best, and she bears other people's pain!

00:15:31.580 --> 00:15:35.000
She can connect people's feelings together!

00:15:35.000 --> 00:15:37.450
That's the Mikono I love!

00:15:37.450 --> 00:15:40.580
Not Silvie! Mikono, right now!

00:15:40.580 --> 00:15:42.120
Don't fuck with me!

00:15:44.080 --> 00:15:47.250
I love her!

00:15:51.340 --> 00:15:53.840
Fate is on my side!

00:15:53.840 --> 00:15:57.780
I'll fly over my fate and live for the present!

00:15:58.100 --> 00:16:01.220
Silvie!
Mikono!

00:16:01.220 --> 00:16:01.230
Mikono!

00:16:14.840 --> 00:16:19.050
It's Amata, and...

00:16:23.330 --> 00:16:28.170
Stop fighting! Amata, Kagura!

00:16:28.170 --> 00:16:30.230
Why should they stop fighting?

00:16:30.750 --> 00:16:31.590
Zessica?

00:16:31.590 --> 00:16:36.850
Refusing to fight is refusing to live.

00:16:37.360 --> 00:16:44.020
You're not going to Union with them.
You're doing it with me, Mikono Suzushiro.

00:16:44.020 --> 00:16:47.140
You're not Zessica! Who are you?

00:16:49.820 --> 00:16:54.400
I am... the Destroyer of Love.

00:16:55.500 --> 00:17:03.660
24,000 years ago, I was betrayed by my betrothed.

00:17:03.660 --> 00:17:05.100
You...

00:17:05.790 --> 00:17:15.300
It was with such hatred in my heart that I fought Apollo, the rebirth of Apollonius.

00:17:15.880 --> 00:17:22.060
But though my love was faint, it was not fully extinguished.

00:17:23.000 --> 00:17:29.190
Apollo wished to unite with me to save this world, and I accepted.

00:17:29.820 --> 00:17:35.640
I was at the height of ecstasy. I would finally become one with my love!

00:17:35.640 --> 00:17:39.410
But in that instant, I knew.

00:17:41.360 --> 00:17:46.330
The very instant our souls touched.

00:17:48.360 --> 00:17:53.210
That Apollo was not the reincarnation of Apollonius.

00:17:55.310 --> 00:17:57.720
The real Apollonius was...

00:18:07.980 --> 00:18:16.010
Not just once, but twice, Apollonius trampled my love.

00:18:18.790 --> 00:18:25.080
I will unite the worlds as one, and become the god of the new world.

00:18:27.130 --> 00:18:31.270
And I will truly be the Destroyer of Love.

00:18:31.930 --> 00:18:36.550
That is the Legend I will write.

00:18:37.270 --> 00:18:39.840
Now, let us unite.

00:18:40.420 --> 00:18:47.240
I won't be satisfied no matter how many times I kill you.

00:18:47.240 --> 00:18:49.100
You harlot!

00:18:53.320 --> 00:18:55.270
What's happening?

00:18:55.820 --> 00:19:00.070
This is the wedding of revenge!

00:19:05.710 --> 00:19:11.270
No! No!

00:19:12.580 --> 00:19:13.710
Mikono!

00:19:14.110 --> 00:19:15.360
That was Silvie!

00:19:23.090 --> 00:19:24.140
That robot!

00:19:27.140 --> 00:19:30.390
Mikono! Mikono's in there!

00:19:31.800 --> 00:19:33.900
More power...

00:19:33.900 --> 00:19:38.900
Ianthe, give me the power of the motherworld!

00:19:57.920 --> 00:20:01.430
Mikage! Are you going to drain the whole planet?

00:20:09.970 --> 00:20:11.880
Amata! Are you okay?

00:20:11.880 --> 00:20:12.920
Cayenne!

00:20:13.440 --> 00:20:15.440
Yunoha and Malloy!

00:20:15.440 --> 00:20:17.820
Take my spot!

00:20:17.820 --> 00:20:21.600
They need your Element power to stand a chance!

00:20:21.600 --> 00:20:24.200
Amata, let's Union!

00:20:24.200 --> 00:20:25.570
Thanks!

00:20:31.960 --> 00:20:33.870
Final Battle Union!

00:20:33.870 --> 00:20:36.790
Go, Aquarion!

00:20:44.360 --> 00:20:46.720
Aquarion Evol!

00:20:48.100 --> 00:20:50.640
Give Mikono back!

00:20:54.860 --> 00:20:57.230
Give her back!

00:20:58.400 --> 00:21:02.650
Punish them, Ianthe.

00:21:07.180 --> 00:21:11.620
A dog with wings dares oppose a weapon of a god?

00:21:12.470 --> 00:21:14.040
Oh, and Kagura.

00:21:40.570 --> 00:21:41.820
Kagura.

00:21:44.490 --> 00:21:50.330
You can't oppose me either, Kagura.

00:21:53.830 --> 00:21:56.450
Violation Union.

00:21:56.450 --> 00:21:58.830
Go, Aquarion.

00:22:05.840 --> 00:22:08.840
Ah, beautiful.

00:22:09.550 --> 00:22:11.850
But empty...

00:22:12.250 --> 00:22:13.600
Mikono!

00:22:25.110 --> 00:22:28.110
A Dark Aquarion...

00:24:12.630 --> 00:24:15.550
It was a miracle that we met.

00:24:15.550 --> 00:24:18.520
And a miracle that we could be together.

00:24:18.960 --> 00:24:19.850
Let's remember it forever.

00:24:19.850 --> 00:24:20.980
Let's pray over its joy.

00:24:22.060 --> 00:24:24.440
Let's become one.
